# Kept out of the build context, not just out of the image: these hold the
# Coolify-generated CouchDB and LiveSync passwords, and the context is
# uploaded to the Docker daemon (over the network, for a remote builder) on
# every build. .gitignore already excludes them from git.
.env
.env.*

